WEBVTT

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.960
Hojo Soun.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.150
AKA Isei Shinkuro.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.380
She was originally a 
servant of the shogun,

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.740
but later became an Imagawa 
retainer while wandering the land.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:16.470
A maiden general who dreams of someday

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.120
becoming a feudal lord herself.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.900
But something's wrong.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.160
This world's too big.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:29.510
The rate of information transfer 
and movement is too fast.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.920
Yes, even in the modern world,

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:35.110
she still hoped to be a 
warring states general,

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:37.850
and was gathering knowledge 
about the world, but...

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:43.020
she realized it was clearly impossible,
and her ambitions waned.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.310
Too bad.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:48.940
Conquering is impossible in this world.

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:51.480
And what's impossible is impossible.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.360
Shinku-chan!

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:55.860
Shinku-chan!

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.830
Shinku-chan, I brought food. 
Would you open the door?

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:03.160
Are you dead?

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:06.920
If you're dead, that's a problem, 
so I'm kicking down the door, okay?

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.920
I'm alive, Mother!

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:10.220
I see.

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:12.030
Then I'll leave this here.

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:14.700
Make sure you eat.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.670
Right.

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:17.680
Okay, see you tomorrow,

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.090
Shinku-chan.

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:24.850
I'm back, Mom.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:27.610
Takahashi Jun.

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:29.150
The eldest daughter of 
the Takahashi family,

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:30.660
whom Soun is staying with.

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:33.790
Well, she's just a normal 
high school student.

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:36.280
There's nothing special about her 
you should remember.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.030
Welcome back, Jun.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:41.530
You looked like you were 
thinking of something.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:42.650
Was it Shinku?

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:45.210
Yeah. She's alive, but there's

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:47.650
nothing she wants to do, it would seem.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:49.960
Conquest, was it?

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.420
Was it that big a shock to 
find out it was impossible?

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:57.190
Don't you think it would be a 
good idea to drag her outside,

00:01:57.190 --> 00:01:59.210
even if we had to make up a reason?

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:00.940
Sure, but...

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:03.180
Did you come up with something?

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:07.770
I'd like to have her go to school.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:12.480
That... That means 
I go with her, right?

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.370
<b>Yagami High School</b>

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:56.610
So this is the last school for me, huh?

00:03:56.610 --> 00:04:00.880
Last? You've never been 
to a school, have you?

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:04.090
There's no school in your world right?

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.130
None.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:06.330
That's right, there aren't!

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.680
Does there have to be?

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.690
Sorry.

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:17.560
<i>Mom said it would work out
if we got her outside,</i>

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.320
<i>but is this really okay?</i>

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:36.460
All right, c-class... I'll uh... 
introduce the transfer student.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:41.580
Um... Isei-san, can you 
introduce yourself?

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:43.090
Introduce myself?

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:45.400
Shinku, your name! Your name!

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:47.340
Tell everybody your name!

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:48.970
I'm supposed to give my name?

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:50.390
Th-That's right.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.730
Say your name in a big, loud voice.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:55.140
A big, loud voice...

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:03.900
Isei Shinkuro!

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:10.910
Isei-san seems to be embarrassed 
about introducing herself.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:20.340
But Fujiwara no Hidehira 
suddenly died of illness,

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:22.050
and, deprived of his backer,

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:25.010
Yoshitsune was soon attacked 
by his brother, Yoritomo.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:27.870
Yoshitsune committed seppuku 
in Hiraizumi in Oushuu,

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.220
ending his life.

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.520
<i>This is bad!</i>

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.890
<i>When the history teacher 
gets mad, he's scary!</i>

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:38.300
...this was officially the founding 
of the Kamakura Shogunate.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:42.150
Hey! Pay attention or he'll get mad!

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:45.850
But we now place it in 1185, 
at the battle of Dannoura.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:50.570
This is an easy mistake 
to make, so pay attention.

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:57.160
Don't sleep in my class!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.890
<b>Dropping Out</b>

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:16.580
Dropping out already?

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.890
That's really bad!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:23.210
It appears I'm not cut 
out for school life.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:26.500
Maybe, but try a little harder!

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:28.070
Okay?

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:30.160
If you insist, Jun...

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:33.380
And that was your fault, Shinku!

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:34.660
You can't attack back!

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.480
There was no way I was

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:40.420
going to just sit back
and let him attack me.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:43.530
But that was your fault...

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:46.270
I held back, so he won't die.

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:50.380
You could kill somebody with 
chalk if you wanted to?

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:53.990
That's how dangerous what he did was.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:57.470
If I didn't attack back, 
I might've been killed.

00:06:57.470 --> 00:07:00.850
I don't think he meant to kill you.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:01.730
Is that so?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.480
Then, maybe I overdid it.

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:07.480
So you can just apologize to him, right?

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:10.990
All right.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.990
<b>Teacher's Office</b>

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:20.080
I'm really sorry.

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:22.700
You, too, Shinku.

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:26.710
She doesn't really understand 
the modern era.

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:30.270
This goes beyond that!

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:31.510
I'm sorry.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:32.870
Shinku feels really bad...

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:34.510
I'm terribly sorry.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.750
Jeez... who sends somebody

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:39.020
to the hospital with a piece of chalk?

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:41.770
I did hold back...

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.980
W-What are you talking about?!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.350
You call this "holding back"?

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:48.430
I'd thought somebody
in a position of

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:50.910
authority would be in
 better physical shape.

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:55.350
You just went a little 
overboard, right, Shinku?

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:56.240
Indeed.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.780
Little? You call this little?

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:01.350
<i>Isei-san is a scary person?</i>

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:03.580
<i>If I upset her, will the 
same thing happen to me?</i>

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:10.830
<i>Come to think of it, 
wasn't there just a thing on TV</i>

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:13.680
<i>that said warring states 
generals were dangerous?</i>

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.420
I'm really sorry.

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:17.950
I'll talk to her about it later.

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:19.770
<b>Teacher's Office</b>

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:19.770
<b>Back to School</b>

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:29.270
Um... Does anyone know the answer?

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:36.200
<i>She's glaring at me.</i>

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.950
<i>Isei-san is glaring at me!</i>

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:42.960
U-Um, anybody?

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.580
I would be honored!

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:50.420
I-Isn't there anybody else?

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.430
Anybody at all?

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:57.930
Sensei, I'll answer it.

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:01.010
Shinku, can you do math?

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:01.820
Are you okay?

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:02.930
You don't have to force yourself.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.900
I'm not forcing myself.

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.190
And there's no problem.

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:08.440
Okay, then.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:12.730
<i>I've got a feeling that if I call on her, 
something terrible will happen.</i>

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:16.570
Is there a problem with me 
answering the question?

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:19.660
N-Not at all!

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:20.580
Okay, Isei-san!

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:22.010
Yes!

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:39.820
Okay.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.220
Is there some problem?

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.720
No, that's right!

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:46.070
It's perfect!

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:48.730
Everyone, let's have a round 
of applause for Isei-san!

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.680
When did Shinku learn math?

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:53.480
Even I didn't know the 
answer to that problem.

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:56.180
I studied since I came here.

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:58.480
I had plenty of time.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:04.500
<i>Good, I didn't get hurt...</i>

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.750
Shinku, do you know how 
to play volleyball?

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:11.810
I'm aware of it.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:14.760
Then I'll toss it, 
so knock it back to me.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:16.760
Very well.

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:18.120
Here I go.

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:23.150
Nice job, Shinku.

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:25.020
When did you practice volleyball?

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:30.020
I've never practiced it, 
but I know the rules.

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.630
So if you know the rules you can play.

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:35.260
That's amazing.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:39.360
Just knocking back a ball is nothing.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:43.230
I know the basic concept, 
but I can't do it at all.

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:50.120
Was that too hard?

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:52.900
No, I'm just bad.

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:04.350
Jun, are you okay?

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:08.100
I'm fine...

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.040
Your nose is bleeding.

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:11.230
Oh...

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.640
Sorry I suck.

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:14.460
That doesn't bother me.

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:17.110
But it seems they know 
what they're doing.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.350
Yeah.

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:21.690
They're all regulars on 
the volleyball team.

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:24.160
So they went after you despite the fact

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.370
that they've got a huge advantage?

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:28.340
Is that wrong?

00:11:28.340 --> 00:11:30.870
You always go after the weak players.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:33.630
So you went after her deliberately?

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:37.390
It's not against the rules.

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.970
Of course, I don't 
think either that girl,

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:40.550
or a warring states general who just

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:44.020
started playing volleyball 
today, could do that.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:48.890
So you won't complain, right?

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.740
If it turns out I could do it...

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:12.290
You told me you wouldn't complain.

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:17.500
You said the same thing, didn't you?

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:20.990
You said the same thing, right?

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:23.330
Shinku, volleyball 
isn't a game where you

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:25.010
knock the other players 
out by hurting them.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:29.070
But they started it, Jun.

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:30.380
You've done more than enough.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:31.680
I got a nosebleed.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.020
But you knocked them out cold!

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.130
I was doing it for you.

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:39.360
I guess I went too far.

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:43.990
I know you were doing it for me,

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:46.320
but violence is bad.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.530
You're right.

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:50.620
You were really good at volleyball!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:52.240
Did you play in middle school?

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:55.540
I told Jun this, but this was 
the first time I've played it.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.640
You did that well for your first time?

00:12:57.640 --> 00:12:59.780
And I didn't go to middle school.

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:00.880
I see.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:03.070
There weren't any middle schools 
where you're from, right?

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:05.050
No, there weren't.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:08.030
But you really seem like 
a general, don't you?

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:09.150
Don't you?!

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:12.060
<i>Shinku's gotten popular.</i>

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:14.880
<i>But I guess it makes sense, 
considering what she did.</i>

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:19.900
<i>I wanted to do something about 
her, so I brought her here.</i>

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.030
<i>But I guess I didn't have to.</i>

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.850
Does it take you a long time to change?

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:31.420
We still have morning classes, right?

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:33.120
Th-That's right.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:35.560
You can go on ahead.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:37.170
No, I'll wait.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:39.500
Assuming it isn't a bother for you.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.230
Oh, thanks.

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:42.130
Just a second.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.550
<i>She's a little odd, 
but Shinku's a nice girl.</i>

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.380
Did something good happen?

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:56.220
Yeah, a little.

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:57.310
I see.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:01.790
<i>I hope she enjoys her time at school.</i>

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:09.030
Out of the way!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:09.950
Sorry!

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:14.450
Is that one of those 
"ruffians" that used to

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:16.330
be popular in this world?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:20.000
Ruffians? Yeah, I guess so.

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:24.500
But it seems they're causing 
problems for everyone.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.460
Well, they look scary.

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:29.050
And you don't know what'll 
happen if you disobey them.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:33.050
In other words, they're controlling 
the school by force.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.990
C-Controlling?

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:37.850
Yeah, maybe...

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.260
I see!

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:42.360
This must be why your mother 
told me to go outside!

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:49.150
She wants me to defeat those 
ruffians and rule the school!

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:54.070
Let's not do this, Shinku!

00:14:54.070 --> 00:14:55.650
It's almost time for class.

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:57.580
You go back to class.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:00.620
I can handle them myself.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.670
That's not the problem...

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.530
There's nothing to worry about.

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:07.490
There's no chance, 
whatsoever, that I'll lose.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.760
Also, I'll be careful not to kill them.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.050
That's not what I meant!

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:14.430
You should just stay away 
from people like that.

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:22.440
By "people like that," 
would you happen to mean us?

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:23.590
Um...

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:29.320
That really hurts our feelings, you know.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:32.410
I'm not here for you.

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:34.780
Would you please call your leader?

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:42.730
Leader? Does she mean Maru-chan?

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:45.290
And what do you mean, "please call them?"

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:48.300
It means I only wish to speak to them.

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:51.970
What did you say, girl?

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.180
Will you not understand 
unless you get hurt?

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:55.680
What?

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:01.810
W-What?!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:08.860
Shall I cut your body, not 
just your belt, next time?

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.050
So you wanted to talk 
to Maru-chan, right?

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:13.350
We'll just go get them for you!

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:17.580
Hey, Shinku.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.400
Let's go back.

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:19.870
Okay?

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:23.500
Then why did I have them 
go get the leader?

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:26.670
And I would feel bad for them.

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:30.950
Their leader will hurt 
them if I'm not around.

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:33.200
So you're worried about that.

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:34.390
What?

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:37.330
A-Anyway, don't use your sword.

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:38.800
If you make a mistake, 
you could hurt yourself.

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:41.770
I'm not so inexperienced 
as to make a mistake.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:43.640
And no punching!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:48.250
So no sword and no fists, okay?

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.660
And...

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:50.900
Then it's settled.

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:53.240
I don't think it's going to be a

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:55.280
problem with them so weak, still...

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:02.070
By weak you mean me, right?

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:03.550
That's her, Maru-chan.

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:05.250
The one with the sword.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.600
Idiot, don't call me Maru-chan!

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:09.130
It sounds kind of cute.

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:10.850
Sorry, Maru-chan!

00:17:10.850 --> 00:17:12.390
I mean Yoshi-kun.

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:16.820
Yoshi-kun doesn't sound 
very tough either.

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:18.140
Shinku...

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:21.890
Do you have a problem with my name?

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:23.960
No, no problem.

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:26.110
I just don't understand 
why Maru-chan's bad

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.690
and Yoshi-kun's okay.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:30.940
There's no need for you to know that.

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.870
True.

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:35.190
I'm Isei Shinkurou.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.570
Your group of ruffians

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:40.530
is causing trouble for 
the rest of the students.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.410
So I'm going to eliminate you.

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:47.460
Sh-Shinku, you need to 
watch what you say!

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:50.740
Then I'll say it clearly.

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:54.510
As of this moment, 
your group is disbanded.

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:58.100
Shut up!

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:03.580
If it weren't for my promise with Jun,

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:05.440
it would've ended right there.

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:08.920
But I keep my promises.

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:11.270
What, you think you've won already?

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:14.110
If you'll allow me an 
overused expression,

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:17.780
if I were serious, you'd be 
dead three times over by now.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:23.280
Will you ever shut your mouth, bitch?

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:33.630
I promised Jun I wouldn't 
use my fists or sword.

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:37.890
But defeating you with 
kicks is too obvious.

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:40.970
I don't know what you're planning,

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:43.220
but neither of you are 
leaving here in one piece.

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:46.470
We will. The both of us. In one piece.

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.180
If you're that sure,

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:50.400
it won't be a problem 
if it's not one on one.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:53.980
I never expected a fair fight from you.

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:56.570
You get her, too, guys!

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:00.240
Jun, you're going to help me.

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:16.970
This isn't what I meant.

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:20.720
Sure, I said don't use your 
fists or your sword, but...

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:25.730
Shinku? What's wrong, Shinku?

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:27.740
That was too easy.

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:31.280
I'm the type who enjoys 
coming from behind, right?

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:32.400
Y-Yeah.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:36.230
If it's too easy, it's not worth doing.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:39.750
I didn't expect teaching them 
a lesson to be this easy.

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:43.050
Is it bad if it's simple?

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:46.540
What's the point of doing something 
if you can do it without effort?

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:49.160
I guess I understand that,

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:52.100
but is it worth getting 
that depressed over?

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:55.350
I guess going to school 
was a mistake after all.

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:59.460
But school isn't about 
beating people up...

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.430
If I can't enjoy that,

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:04.550
then what's the point 
of coming to school?

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.830
Was that all you came to school for?

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:09.350
Was that all?

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:11.740
Um...

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:13.770
I know, Shinku!

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.090
What?

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:19.740
Do you think maybe these guys were 
just the tip of the iceberg?

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:21.740
What did you say?

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:27.240
Th-They might not be the true 
rulers of the school, right?

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.360
You're right.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:32.960
If you make your rule that obvious, 
you'll invite rebellion!

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.440
Y-Yeah.

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:37.750
But, if it wasn't them, 
then who's the true ruler of the school?

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:41.920
Maybe there's like a 
shadow ruffian alliance

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:45.010
who controls them from behind the scenes?

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:47.010
<i>Not that I've ever seen one.</i>

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:49.520
A shadow ruffian alliance!

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:52.290
I'm all fired up!

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:54.490
<i>That fires her up?!</i>

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:57.520
<i>Was this really a good idea?</i>

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:02.380
A mysterious girl.

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:05.580
Since I call her "mysterious girl," 
her nature is mysterious.

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:08.090
What? I didn't really 
need to explain that?

00:21:08.090 --> 00:21:09.640
Oh, you're right.

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:13.660
That outfit... That strength...

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:16.710
It must be Hojo Soun.

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.890
You were in the middle of training?

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:38.230
Then I'll come back.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:39.860
Sessai-sensei?

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:43.750
You can stay. It's important, right?

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:49.230
Regarding Isei Shinkurou, 
who we spoke of this morning...

00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:52.120
The one who's supposedly 
a warring states general?

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:56.570
Yes. That was Hojo Soun.

00:21:56.570 --> 00:22:00.310
I don't know why she's 
using a different name.

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:01.350
I see.

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:04.130
So Soun is here, too.

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:09.640
Now I'll be able to defeat 
Nobunaga for sure.

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:50.000
Next time is the Ambitious 
Princess Hojo Soun.

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:54.240
Next time on Sengoku Collection: 
"Ambitious Princess Part 2."

00:23:54.240 --> 00:23:59.030
Giving my own introduction... 
that's no fun at all.
